{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】武警官兵開裝甲車訓練，挑戰直角限制路極限轉彎。轉彎路兩側放置氣球，裝甲車行駛時碰到即為不合格！面對裝甲車車身長、空間窄，裝甲車挑戰直角轉彎絕對是極高難度，究竟能否順過「掟彎」？</p>\n<p>資訊及視頻來源：央視軍事</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:04:02.802606+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:28.071308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:28.071308+00:00","content_hash":"25772394eb220828baa2c8e4cadff08fcc51f133afa98f631c2ab59019d11d73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}